## Interface: 16001
## Title: Gamepad Crosshair Customizer
## Notes: Customizes the controller's aiming dot: its shape, size, color and border, and an icon on a target (a player's class, a raid marker). Settings in Options > AddOns > Gamepad Crosshair Customizer, or /gcc.
